Subject: [PATCH] wave: use the coherent WRX600 A0 firmware interface

Adapt the pinned TP-Link host source to the fixed WRX600 A0 cohort shipped
in NETGEAR RAX40 V1 1.0.6.106. Preserve the OpenWrt Linux lifetime, locking,
DMA and station ownership fixes. Match CHI, mailbox publication, all control
slot size dependencies, command namespace, producer defaults and the complete
fixed statistics snapshot while retaining normalized host consumers.

The reference declarations are from opensag/atom-openwrt commit
ff4f04f2f2c36a507d27406a040105cc763d2f89. Its module LICENSE and the original
file notices are retained. Shipped native module evidence establishes the
selected wire layouts; this is not a wholesale donor-driver replacement.
Rebuild the native RF C archive against these headers before driver linking.

